    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "Two years ago the world was overrun by a strange crystalline anomaly known as the Crystal Plague.<br>Now you have to protect yourself and fight back against this new threat everyday.<br>Oh well\u2026<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">With a mix of both classic and new survivors-like tropes, Tight Ride offers a different view on action rogue-lites:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Ride an amazing vehicle that never slows down in a post-apocalyptic survival fantasy<br></li><li>Play as a group of characters, each one having a unique arsenal and a set of perks<br></li><li>Use different combinations of auto-aiming weapons (and their evolutions!) to your advantage<br></li><li>Face multiple enemy types, each requiring different approach<br></li><li>Experiment with dozens of different perks and upgrades<br></li><li>Overcome challenges through your own skill and luck, not meta-progression and power creep</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Two years ago the world was overrun by a strange crystalline anomaly known as the Crystal Plague.<br>Now you have to protect yourself and fight back against this new threat everyday.<br>Oh well\u2026<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">With a mix of both classic and new survivors-like tropes, Tight Ride offers a different view on action rogue-lites:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Ride an amazing vehicle that never slows down in a post-apocalyptic survival fantasy<br></li><li>Play as a group of characters, each one having a unique arsenal and a set of perks<br></li><li>Use different combinations of auto-aiming weapons (and their evolutions!) to your advantage<br></li><li>Face multiple enemy types, each requiring different approach<br></li><li>Experiment with dozens of different perks and upgrades<br></li><li>Overcome challenges through your own skill and luck, not meta-progression and power creep</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Tight Ride is an adrenaline-fueled Arena Survival game. Your mission? To decimate waves upon waves of brainless zombies. But here's the twist: you won't be fighting on foot. No, no, no. You'll be cruising in a tactical buggy equipped with an array of heavy weaponry. Now buckle up.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
